# --- Vendored dependency bundle (PM_GH_REPO_005) ---
# This repository commits node_modules/ on purpose. The upstream Node template's
# unanchored `node_modules/`, `dist` and `.env` rules would otherwise hide files that
# are already tracked here. Both lines are needed: the first re-includes the directory,
# the second re-includes paths beneath it that later packaging rules would still match.
!node_modules/
!node_modules/**

# --- Tracked `out/` is source, not build output (PM_GH_REPO_005) ---
# The Node template's unanchored `out` rule (Next.js build output) matches this repo's
# tracked out/ directory, which holds a committed Postman collection. Anchoring to /out
# would not help -- the directory is at the root -- so negate it instead.
!out/
!out/**
